{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Farol del Diablo </i>(<i>Devil\u2019s Lantern</i>) is a horror game set in Loma Quebrada, an Argentinian town shrouded in darkness and folklore.  Catalina embarks on a thorough search for riches despite the rumors of the Luz Mala haunting the grounds. Uncover the dark secrets of the village before the night engulfs you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a dark atmosphere and an oppressive soundscape with first-person camera controls.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the village and speak with the townspeople to unravel the dreadful truth.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect the treasures guarded by the Luz Mala.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Save your life by biting the sheath of a knife.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep your flashlight on\u2014she will be your best companion.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Overcome your fear of being defenseless as you face indescribable dangers.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3544060?t=1770141499","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3544060?t=1770141499","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544060/5aae8100c73b67c625b748d7bb243f39a93e0d76/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770141499","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544060/5aae8100c73b67c625b748d7bb243f39a93e0d76/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770141499","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Farol del Diablo </i>(<i>Devil\u2019s Lantern</i>) is a horror game set in Loma Quebrada, an Argentinian town shrouded in darkness and folklore.  Catalina embarks on a thorough search for riches despite the rumors of the Luz Mala haunting the grounds. Uncover the dark secrets of the village before the night engulfs you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a dark atmosphere and an oppressive soundscape with first-person camera controls.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the village and speak with the townspeople to unravel the dreadful truth.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect the treasures guarded by the Luz Mala.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Save your life by biting the sheath of a knife.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep your flashlight on\u2014she will be your best companion.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Overcome your fear of being defenseless as you face indescribable dangers.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Arcanum: Game Forge"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544060/07dd5dbbbd4560628f097818722829447bb1c922/header.jpg?t=1770141499","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3544060/1943035925/69d6982522c6b3d3e859151b97568d115659f33f/1768770612/dash_av1.mpd?t=1768771200","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3544060/1943035925/69d6982522c6b3d3e859151b97568d115659f33f/1768770612/dash_h264.mpd?t=1768771200","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3544060/1943035925/69d6982522c6b3d3e859151b97568d115659f33f/1768770612/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1768771200","id":257100174,"name":"Trailer Gameplay Farol del Diablo Espa\u00f1ol","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257100174/c44d9c3b8856791fac2cbcc4a14db1cc70b89c2